# Normalise line endings in the repository rather than the working tree.
#
# Without this, a file is CRLF on a Windows checkout and LF on the Linux CI
# runner and Docker builder, so every diff carries whole-file noise. The working
# tree normalises on the next checkout; files already committed keep their
# existing bytes until something rewrites them.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending translated.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.joblib binary
*.safetensors binary

# Keep the model artifacts out of any diff-aware tooling that mangles them.
trading_agent/agent/model/* binary
